sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as Connectors<br/>(Chrome ext · Gmail · YouTube)
    participant G as FastAPI Gateway<br/>+ Storage Engine
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant E as ENP Worker<br/>(background thread)
    participant F as FAISS Index

    rect rgb(234, 240, 255)
    Note over U,P: Capture — only engaged activity passes the intent gate
    U->>C: Reads page / watches video / receives email
    C->>C: Intent gate (dwell, scroll, playback, revisit)
    C->>G: Send captured item
    G->>P: store_memory_item() — one atomic transaction,<br/>UNIQUE(source_type, source_id) dedup
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 240)
    Note over P,F: Enrichment — background worker, never blocks capture
    E->>P: Poll items where preprocessed = FALSE
    E->>E: Clean text → embed (MiniLM, 384-d) → classify group
    E->>F: Append vector
    E->>P: Mark processed (failed → retry on demand)
    end
